2026-10-13T19:48:37.0825360Z     "read_page gives refs for every control; find answers a description with the right ref",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0826819Z     "form_input, computer type and click fill and submit a form (the Send click pauses first); get_page_text reads the result",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0828169Z     "javascript, read_console_messages and read_network_requests answer from the tab",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0829176Z     "computer key=Return submits the form the way a keyboard would",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0830248Z     "a refusal is a tool error, not a crash; tabs_close removes the agent's tab and leaves the person's",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0831478Z     "a purchase pauses for the person; Block becomes a tool error, Allow lets the click through",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0832363Z     "typing into a password field pauses",
2026-10-13T19:48:37.0832944Z     "in ask mode even a harmless click pauses",
